[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/orb-of-ages-light.png" id="3_icon"]

; Merlin's own (.ai/merlin.md), and no one else's: UnlockCatalog's ExclusiveTo keeps it out of every other
; wizard's level-up pool. A ward drawn on the ground where he stands, and the orb from his staff ricocheting
; inside it along a seven-pointed star; everything it strikes is Weakened. The ward closes when he steps out
; of it or its time runs out, and the cooldown starts when the orb is home (OrbOfAges, Player.FireOrbOfAges).
;
; BaseRange is unused: the ring's size is Player.OrbWardRadius times Area. AreaSize widens the ring (two lines,
; 15% each), and the orb grows and flies faster with it; ZoneDuration is seconds more the ward stands (two lines,
; a second each); a second orb at 6, running the star the other way.
; First numbers (8 a stroke, 2.0 s, a 6 s ward, 760 px/s) after the bot's first 8 minutes on 6 / 2.5 / 5 / 620
; gave the spell 11.8% of Merlin's damage at level 2 against Kindled Ward's 25.8% of Seimei's (.ai/merlin.md). Every level is written
; out, so the scaling tags (Area, Duration) generate nothing; Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps still adds its +1
; damage on a level with none and its -0.08 s cooldown on an even level with none.
